        "A practical weekly dashboard should include:\nSales\n- Orders.\n- Net revenue.\n- Average order value.\n- Revenue by product.\n- Revenue by channel.\nMarketing\n- Ad spend.\n- Customer acquisition cost.\n- Conversion rate.\n- Contribution after acquisition.\n- Creative performance.\nProduct and operations\n- Units sold by SKU.\n- Stock on hand.\n- Weeks of cover.\n- Supplier lead times.\n- Defects.\n- Returns.\n- Dispatch time.\nFinance\n- Gross profit.\n- Contribution profit.\n- Operating expenses.\n- Cash balance.\n- Cash forecast.\n- Supplier payments due.\n- Inventory commitments."
